{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06936","headline":"太公哀晚遇 · 常建","name":"太公哀晚遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出渭流白，文王畋猎时。\n钓翁在芦苇，川泽无熊罴。\n诏书起遗贤，匹马令致辞。\n因称江海人，臣老筋力衰。\n迟迟诣天车，快快悟灵龟。\n兵马更不猎，君臣皆共怡。\n同车至咸阳，心影无磷缁。\n四牡玉墀下，一言爲帝师。\n王侯拥朱门，轩盖曜长逵。\n古来荣华人，遭遇谁知之。\n落日悬桑榆，光景有顿亏。\n倏忽天地人，虽贵将何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}